  "body": "## Change and scope\n\nAnswers the unequal-price handoff in [#1898](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/1898) / open question tracked via [#2455](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2455): under path-lowered even-subset schedules and the PR1898 tariff `(b,a,x)=(38,2,2)`, can a 7\u20139 query mutable-source word beat the sharp six-query endpoint tariff **436**?\n\nNo. Exact invoices show:\n\n| Q | R | X | Tariff |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| 6 (endpoint) | 96 | 8 | **436** |\n| **7 (exact min)** | **82** | **6** | **442** |\n| 8 (floor) | \u226574 | \u22650 | **\u2265452** |\n| 9 (floor) | \u226562 | \u22650 | **\u2265466** |\n\nPackage is freestanding (`research/mutable-source-789q-invoice/`). Leave-alone through [#2643](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2643) (including [#2593](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2593) and [#2487](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2487)) was not reopened. Path-lowered schedule class only; non-path XOR floor at Q=7 is settled separately by [#2643](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2643).\n\n**Priced finite invoice / obstruction; no new kappa.**\n\n## Result\n\nQ=7 has exact minimum tariff **442** at `(R,X)=(82,6)`, with certified attainable R spectrum `{82,88}` (intermediate R\u2208{83..87} excluded by exhaustive census). Q=8 and Q=9 admit only floors **452** and **466** under the same fixture. None beats the Q=6 endpoint **436**.\n\nPackage: `research/mutable-source-789q-invoice/`.\nTip: `e703687cc7a3cb4dd3834aa12d8816ddb134a4ae`.\n\n## Validation\n\n```sh\npython3.12 -I -B research/mutable-source-789q-invoice/verify.py\npython3.12 -I -O -B research/mutable-source-789q-invoice/verify.py\npython3.12 -I -B research/mutable-source-789q-invoice/independent.py\npython3.12 -I -B research/mutable-source-789q-invoice/test_package.py\npython3.12 -B scripts/research_package.py --package research/mutable-source-789q-invoice\n```\n\nExpected:\n\n```text\nPASS_MUTABLE_SOURCE_789Q_INVOICE Q6=436 Q7=442 Q8_floor=452 Q9_floor=466 no_new_kappa\nPASS_INDEPENDENT_789Q_INVOICE champion=442 floors=452,466 R_spectrum=[82, 88] controls=2\nPASS_REGISTERED_RESEARCH_PACKAGE research/mutable-source-789q-invoice outcome=completed\n```\n\nDefault verify is read-only. Full `make verify`, selected cold replay, Lean, and multiplication-theorem obligations were not rerun for this isolated invoice package.\n\n## Overlap and credit\n\nClosest priors: [#1898](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/1898) (tariff fixture / unequal-price handoff), [#2455](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2455) OQ1, [#1370](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/1370), [#2643](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2643) (Q=7 XOR floor for the full restored alphabet). Leave-alone through [#2643](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2643). No competing open PR on this freestanding path-lowered 7\u20139Q invoice package at refresh.\n\nCredit the mutable-source / PR1898 lineage. Prepared by Wentao Li ([VictorLiwentao](https://github.com/VictorLiwentao), [@Is__Victor](https://x.com/Is__Victor)) with substantial AI assistance, under Apache-2.0.",
